<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Disclaimer&nbsp;</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We are continually improving the appearance and content of this website <br>and the underlying database. The data reported are only as complete and <br>accurate as the records received from our data sources.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you notice information that is incomplete, incorrect, or out of date, <br>please contact the NYU Furman Center via our <a href="https://www.furmancenter.org/data-inquiries/" data-type="link" data-id="https://www.furmancenter.org/data-inquiries/">User Feedback Form.</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The NYU Furman Center, the Robert F. Wagner Graduate School of Public <br>Service, the New York University School of Law, New York University, and <br>any of their respective faculty, staff, and administrators assume no liability <br>associated with the use or misuse of this data and specifically disclaim any <br>warranties, either expressed or implied, including, but not limited to, the <br>implied warranties of merchantability and fitness for a particular purpose. <br>Users of this data assume full responsibility for any loss or damages incurred <br>as a result of their use of or reliance on this data and this website.<br><br></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
