        aria-expanded="false"
    >
        <span class="fur-title--heading-5">
            Data Updates        </span>

        <span class="fur-flex fur-items-center fur-justify-center fur-w-[46px] fur-h-[46px] fur-shrink-0 fur-rounded-full fur-border fur-border-purple fur-text-purple group-hover/accordion-item:fur-border-white group-hover/accordion-item:fur-text-white fur-transition-colors fur-duration-200">
            <svg class="js-accordion-caret fur-w-4 fur-h-4 fur-transition-transform fur-duration-300"
  viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M8 0V16M0 8H16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />
</svg>        </span>
    </button>

    <div class="js-accordion-content fur-overflow-hidden" style="max-height: 0;">
        <div class="fur-py-6 fur-px-6 lg:fur-px-8 fur-flex fur-flex-col fur-gap-8 fur-border-t fur-border-t-[1px] fur-border-solid fur-border-purple">
                            <div class="wysiwyg-content fur-body--sm fur-text-black fur-max-w-[840px]">
                    <p><span style="font-weight: 400">Neighborhood Indicators are updated on an annual basis. The years for which Neighborhood Indicator data are available are shown in a dropdown menu on </span><a href="http://coredata.nyc/"><span style="font-weight: 400">CoreData.nyc</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400">.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Program data in the Subsidized Housing Database is updated periodically as data becomes available.  </span></p>
                </div>

                                    </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="js-accordion-item fur-bg-peach">
    <button
        class="js-accordion-toggle fur-flex fur-items-center fur-justify-between fur-w-full fur-text-left fur-cursor-pointer fur-bg-peach fur-px-6 lg:fur-px-8 fur-py-6 fur-text-purple hover:fur-text-white hover:fur-bg-purple fur-transition-colors fur-duration-200 fur-group/accordion-item fur-gap-8"
        aria-expanded="false"
    >
        <span class="fur-title--heading-5">
            Citing CoreData.NYC        </span>

        <span class="fur-flex fur-items-center fur-justify-center fur-w-[46px] fur-h-[46px] fur-shrink-0 fur-rounded-full fur-border fur-border-purple fur-text-purple group-hover/accordion-item:fur-border-white group-hover/accordion-item:fur-text-white fur-transition-colors fur-duration-200">
            <svg class="js-accordion-caret fur-w-4 fur-h-4 fur-transition-transform fur-duration-300"
  viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M8 0V16M0 8H16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />
</svg>        </span>
    </button>

    <div class="js-accordion-content fur-overflow-hidden" style="max-height: 0;">
        <div class="fur-py-6 fur-px-6 lg:fur-px-8 fur-flex fur-flex-col fur-gap-8 fur-border-t fur-border-t-[1px] fur-border-solid fur-border-purple">
                            <div class="wysiwyg-content fur-body--sm fur-text-black fur-max-w-[840px]">
                    <p><a href="http://coredata.nyc/"><span style="font-weight: 400">CoreData.nyc</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400"> and its maps, tables, and other resources may be incorporated into your work and research, and may be cited as: </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400">NYU Furman Center’s CoreData.nyc</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400">.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Please preserve all trademarks and logos on any exported maps, tables, or property reports.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">For academic and research presentations, please follow the citation formats below:</span></p>
<h3><span style="font-weight: 400">APA Style</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Data Source. Table Title [format]. Data date. NYU Furman Center’s CoreData.nyc. permalink URL. (date accessed)</span></p>
<h3><span style="font-weight: 400">Chicago Style</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Title of map, dates. NYU Furman Center’s CoreData.nyc, permalink URL (based on data from &lt;identify data source&gt;; date accessed).</span></p>
<h3><span style="font-weight: 400">MLA Style</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Title of map, dates. Map. NYU Furman Center’s CoreData.nyc, permalink URL (based on data from &lt;identify data source&gt;; date accessed).</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">For questions about citing </span><a href="http://coredata.nyc/"><span style="font-weight: 400">CoreData.nyc</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400"> for use in a media outlet, please contact our communications office at </span><span style="font-weight: 400">furmancenter@nyu.edu</span><span style="font-weight: 400">.</span></p>
                </div>

                                    </div>
    </div>
</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
