    </h2>
  
      <p class="fur-body--md fur-text-black fur-max-w-[900px]">
      The NYU Furman Center hosts webinars and training sessions for CoreData.nyc users, including policymakers, journalists, and the general public.
    </p>
  
  		<div class="fur-flex fur-flex-wrap fur-items-center fur-gap-8">
